    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Million Dream</i> is a 3D action game set in a realistic city,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where you collect money falling from the sky and aim to become fabulously rich.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844820/extras/2d80c930b6d93186cbcab550d618e176.poster.avif?t=1752009034\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844820/extras/2d80c930b6d93186cbcab550d618e176.webm?t=1752009034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844820/extras/2d80c930b6d93186cbcab550d618e176.mp4?t=1752009034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Setting</strong><br>One day, money starts raining from the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lucky middle-aged man, scrambling to gather as much cash as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Items</strong><br>Use the money you've collected to purchase useful items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each upgrade boosts your collection efficiency and adds new possibilities to your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Police Chase</strong><br>The city is patrolled by diligent officers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get too greedy, you might get arrested\u2014so don\u2019t get too carried away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Movement</strong><br>Enjoy the silly, unpredictable charm of physics-based movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ridiculous visuals and slapstick animations bring chaotic fun to every moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>End of the Dream</strong><br>What awaits at the end of your path to riches...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this just a dream\u2014or something more? See for yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Recommended For</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of surreal or absurd worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who enjoy ridiculous, over-the-top games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players looking for a short but satisfying experience (Estimated playtime: 1\u20132 hours)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone who\u2019s ever dreamed of being rich\u2014at least for a little while</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Million Dream</i> is a 3D action game set in a realistic city,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where you collect money falling from the sky and aim to become fabulously rich.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844820/extras/2d80c930b6d93186cbcab550d618e176.poster.avif?t=1752009034\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844820/extras/2d80c930b6d93186cbcab550d618e176.webm?t=1752009034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844820/extras/2d80c930b6d93186cbcab550d618e176.mp4?t=1752009034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Setting</strong><br>One day, money starts raining from the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lucky middle-aged man, scrambling to gather as much cash as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Items</strong><br>Use the money you've collected to purchase useful items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each upgrade boosts your collection efficiency and adds new possibilities to your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Police Chase</strong><br>The city is patrolled by diligent officers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get too greedy, you might get arrested\u2014so don\u2019t get too carried away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Movement</strong><br>Enjoy the silly, unpredictable charm of physics-based movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ridiculous visuals and slapstick animations bring chaotic fun to every moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>End of the Dream</strong><br>What awaits at the end of your path to riches...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this just a dream\u2014or something more? See for yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Recommended For</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of surreal or absurd worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who enjoy ridiculous, over-the-top games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players looking for a short but satisfying experience (Estimated playtime: 1\u20132 hours)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone who\u2019s ever dreamed of being rich\u2014at least for a little while</p></li></ul>",
